## ====== Visual Studio Files ======
## Cache folders and user-specific configurations
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## ====== Build Outputs ======
## Prevents compiled binaries and temporary XAML generation files from being tracked
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

## ====== .NET / NuGet ======
## Excludes local package downloads and project restoration caches
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

## ====== OS Specific Files ======
## Cleans up desktop metadata files
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
